From 522f056884c3d63de72627520b9a51448a252ae8 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Claude <noreply@anthropic.com>
Date: Sat, 3 Oct 2026 06:40:01 +0200
Subject: [PATCH] NHFLOW AMR: vertical refinement (A 281 1), nested sigma
 layers doubled on every level

Limited linear, mean-preserving prolongation of U, V, W within each coarse
layer, nested pressure nodes (odd nodes linear), 2x2x2 restriction, coarse
interface fluxes as the mean of the two fine faces in both fine layers.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
Claude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_014HX78HZiTjrxAkgQpNoML1
